# Defensive patterns added during capture-v6 idempotency work
supabase/.branches/
*.bak-pre-tidy

# Defensive pattern: scrub_and_build.py double-/app prefix remediation. Earlier
# versions of scrub_and_build.py constructed STUB as
# `CAM / 'app' / 'tests' / 'e2e' / '_baseline-run.json'` where CAM = Path(CAMARAS)
# and capture-v6.sh L13-L14 exports CAMARAS="$HOME/USB-Uncensored-LLM/Linux/app"
# (CAMARAS already contains /app). The double-prefix produced the dead path
# `app/tests/e2e/_baseline-run.json` directly under a nested `app/` directory
# which capture-v6.sh's `git add $STUB_REL` (STUB_REL="tests/e2e/_baseline-run.json")
# could not see, FATAL'ing exit 37 NOTHING_STAGED after bash's
# `git status --porcelain | grep '^[AM]'` matched zero entries. Pattern suppresses
# the dead path so a future regression does not re-surface as diagnostic noise.
app/
